WEBVTT

01:43.102 --> 01:45.188
‎No! Stop!

01:45.271 --> 01:46.898
‎Don't do this, Talia!

01:46.981 --> 01:49.275
‎-Where's my fucking back-up?!
‎-Talia!

01:50.735 --> 01:54.781
‎What're you doing, Talia?!
‎That's your dad!

01:55.949 --> 01:58.618
‎Hmm. No camera today?

01:59.911 --> 02:01.079
‎Talia?

02:01.162 --> 02:04.624
‎And spare me. That isn't my dad.

02:04.707 --> 02:07.168
‎-Talia! Of course I'm your--
‎-Shut up!

02:10.505 --> 02:14.384
‎He killed my mom! He's not my dad.

02:18.596 --> 02:21.307
‎I promised I'd kill him.

02:36.865 --> 02:37.991
‎Talia!

02:38.074 --> 02:41.119
‎-Outta the way, kid!
‎-Target confirmed.

02:41.202 --> 02:44.164
‎Immobilize, do not kill!
‎Focus fire on her limbs!

02:53.882 --> 02:56.134
‎Now. Grab her while she's down--

03:06.853 --> 03:08.396
‎Go!

03:18.239 --> 03:20.408
‎Get me out of here! Hurry!

03:20.491 --> 03:21.868
‎Huh? But...

03:21.951 --> 03:23.912
‎She's after me!

03:31.586 --> 03:34.964
‎-‎1-0 to 1-4, report on status.
‎-‎Call for backup! Fall back!

03:35.048 --> 03:38.426
‎Don't stop! Keep going! Anywhere but here!

03:44.390 --> 03:45.391
‎Are you...

03:47.435 --> 03:48.436
‎Capri?

03:48.978 --> 03:50.063
‎D?

03:55.276 --> 03:57.320
‎He's alive?!

04:00.949 --> 04:02.533
‎Shut up!

04:07.121 --> 04:09.916
‎Shut up, shut up, shut up! Fuck!

04:18.758 --> 04:20.009
‎D! Get up!

04:38.528 --> 04:41.906
‎-Ow!
‎-The hell are you doing?!

04:41.990 --> 04:44.575
‎That hurt! Knock it off, Omi!

04:44.659 --> 04:48.246
‎Huh? Wha... Roman?

04:48.955 --> 04:50.999
‎What're you doing here?

04:56.838 --> 04:58.381
‎Ah, I remember now.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.425
‎That her? Your girlfriend?

05:01.134 --> 05:03.344
‎She's not my girlfriend.

05:03.428 --> 05:06.222
‎Mind tellin' me how
‎she wound up with Capri?

05:06.306 --> 05:07.890
‎-You didn't chip her again?
‎-I did that.

05:07.974 --> 05:09.892
‎-Like hell I did.
‎-‎It was me!

05:09.976 --> 05:12.395
‎Then how the heck does she have Capri?!

05:12.478 --> 05:13.604
‎I said I did it!

05:13.688 --> 05:16.024
‎-My stereo's glitchin'.
‎-Yeah, wait...

05:16.107 --> 05:17.275
‎Just shut the fuck up!

05:17.984 --> 05:21.362
‎I chipped 'er with Capri!
‎Glad you're not dead, by the way.

05:21.946 --> 05:23.614
‎Kang Tao fucked up in our favor.

05:24.532 --> 05:25.533
‎Kyoko?

05:26.951 --> 05:29.662
‎Roman. I figured you'd be there.

05:29.746 --> 05:31.372
‎Why'd you do it, Kyoko? Wha--

05:31.456 --> 05:33.791
‎You're that short broad from before.

05:34.500 --> 05:35.543
‎What're you after?

05:36.210 --> 05:38.880
‎That entirely depends. It still installed?

05:38.963 --> 05:41.174
‎-Don't follow.
‎-‎You will if you answer me.

05:42.216 --> 05:44.302
‎Is Capri still inside your head?
‎Yes or no?

05:45.178 --> 05:46.179
‎It matters.

05:48.097 --> 05:52.185
‎Yeah. A little. But only a little.

05:52.268 --> 05:55.563
‎What are you planning
‎to use Capricorn for?

05:55.646 --> 05:58.441
‎-Use?
‎-‎Yes. Once you get the shard--

05:58.524 --> 06:01.986
‎Not gonna. I just wanna see Capri again.

06:02.070 --> 06:03.321
‎What?

06:04.030 --> 06:05.448
‎I don't care what happens after.

06:10.161 --> 06:12.330
‎That's kind of impressive.

06:12.413 --> 06:14.832
‎I wish we'd met under
‎different circumstances.

06:16.834 --> 06:19.629
‎Fine. I'll help you.

06:19.712 --> 06:21.839
‎Not like any of us'll survive this anyway.

06:23.925 --> 06:25.676
‎You're pretty damn full of yourself.

06:26.427 --> 06:29.430
‎But I know I can't do this on my own.

06:29.514 --> 06:32.600
‎And here I thought you had no sense.

06:35.686 --> 06:37.939
‎What's got you gigglin'?

06:38.022 --> 06:39.982
‎Nothin'.

06:40.066 --> 06:42.860
‎But I can tell you're serious about this.

06:42.944 --> 06:44.237
‎What's that supposed to mean?

06:44.320 --> 06:45.321
‎Hey.

06:46.864 --> 06:47.865
‎Hey...

06:48.699 --> 06:50.243
‎Sorry. Seriously, sorry.

06:52.411 --> 06:55.039
‎So, D... You're not out for revenge anymore?

06:56.999 --> 06:58.126
‎No.

07:14.559 --> 07:18.479
‎Capture's no longer possible. I need evac.

07:18.563 --> 07:19.772
‎Please hurry--

07:20.815 --> 07:23.276
‎Damn it! Stop! Don't come any closer!

07:30.408 --> 07:32.785
‎Stop! Talia!

07:39.709 --> 07:40.793
‎Stop!

07:46.340 --> 07:47.800
‎You shouldn't have to do this.

07:50.261 --> 07:53.681
‎I'll finish him. This is for Avida.

07:57.018 --> 07:58.936
‎Shit! Why--

08:01.522 --> 08:03.441
‎Don't get in my way.

08:12.825 --> 08:14.452
‎Kill her!

08:14.535 --> 08:17.455
‎But our orders were to capture the target.

08:17.538 --> 08:19.248
‎Look at the size of it!

08:19.332 --> 08:20.458
‎This wasn't on the brief!

08:20.541 --> 08:22.210
‎Just kill her!

08:28.591 --> 08:29.592
‎Talia...

08:33.346 --> 08:34.347
‎Not yet...

08:35.806 --> 08:37.517
‎It's not too late.

08:41.896 --> 08:45.525
‎I promised I'd be here to bring you back.

08:46.859 --> 08:50.029
‎It's not over. You'll be okay.

09:02.416 --> 09:03.960
‎Talia.

09:43.165 --> 09:44.625
‎What the hell're you doing?

09:45.585 --> 09:47.837
‎Omi, take a right up here.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.046
‎You know where she is?

09:49.714 --> 09:51.048
‎Kinda.

09:52.633 --> 09:55.177
‎No... This is a mistake.

09:55.261 --> 09:57.972
‎Why me, Talia?

09:58.848 --> 10:01.767
‎Capture may no longer be a viable option.

10:01.851 --> 10:03.019
‎So I see.

10:03.102 --> 10:05.521
‎Eliminate it before
‎the other corporations notice.

10:06.230 --> 10:09.358
‎-We'll recover what we can afterwards.
‎-But how?

10:09.442 --> 10:11.527
‎The quickest way is an airstrike.

10:11.611 --> 10:13.070
‎In Night City?

10:17.908 --> 10:20.786
‎Copy that, sir.
‎We'll begin leading the target south.

10:21.871 --> 10:24.582
‎Shit. This is bad. An airstrike?!

10:24.665 --> 10:27.251
‎Hey, what's our current heading?

10:27.960 --> 10:30.004
‎South? The Badlands?

10:31.714 --> 10:33.090
‎They called an airstrike!

10:46.896 --> 10:48.064
‎Avida.

10:59.575 --> 11:00.868
‎Talia.

11:00.951 --> 11:03.496
‎Damn it...

11:40.616 --> 11:43.911
‎-Too late! He's already left!
‎-What?!

11:43.994 --> 11:46.414
‎Said he wasn't gonna
‎sit around and took off!

11:47.790 --> 11:51.544
‎Roman, listen to me!
‎Get D back before I get there!

11:51.627 --> 11:53.129
‎Hold on a sec!

11:53.212 --> 11:56.924
‎I'm bringing a CPRN-XW1.

11:57.007 --> 11:58.050
‎What's that?

11:58.134 --> 12:00.886
‎Think of it like a huge EMP.

12:00.970 --> 12:05.558
‎If I trigger it, every electronic device
‎within a 2 kilometer radius will go down.

12:05.641 --> 12:08.936
‎It should pierce Capri too.
‎This is what we'll use.

12:09.019 --> 12:12.898
‎While it's active, you all need
‎to stay away from her.

12:12.982 --> 12:15.860
‎Get through to D any way you can,

12:15.943 --> 12:17.695
‎then get outta there
‎before I arrive. Got it?

12:24.034 --> 12:27.788
‎Snap out of it, Capri.
‎You're still in there, aren't you?

12:38.674 --> 12:41.218
‎Dammit! Don't get in my way!

12:41.927 --> 12:43.762
‎What's happening over there?!

12:43.846 --> 12:45.764
‎How long does it take
‎to bring down one target?

12:45.848 --> 12:49.477
‎-We're paying for every second.
‎-All comm lines are down!

12:49.560 --> 12:51.604
‎I think Capricorn's disrupting the signal!

12:54.273 --> 12:57.359
‎Why, Talia? Why?

12:58.027 --> 12:59.987
‎You were always a good girl.

13:00.488 --> 13:04.533
‎You could've become something wonderful.

13:04.617 --> 13:06.494
‎And been my saving grace.

13:07.244 --> 13:08.245
‎Talia!

13:08.954 --> 13:10.998
‎That's my girl, Talia.

13:14.210 --> 13:15.878
‎My good girl.

13:15.961 --> 13:17.546
‎Shut up!

13:23.969 --> 13:24.970
‎What?

13:31.143 --> 13:33.187
‎It's no good. I can't get through!

13:33.270 --> 13:34.897
‎Can't we get any closer?

13:34.980 --> 13:37.107
‎No! Are you crazy?!

13:41.028 --> 13:43.072
‎-Kyoko!
‎-He's not here?!

13:43.155 --> 13:45.616
‎He can't reach us! Look at that thing!

13:46.408 --> 13:48.077
‎Tell me he's alive! Better be!

13:49.495 --> 13:51.163
‎How would I know?!

13:56.794 --> 14:00.130
‎This isn't like you, Capri.

14:05.302 --> 14:08.764
‎What do we do now?
‎There's no covering this up anymore.

14:08.847 --> 14:10.015
‎Clearly.

14:10.099 --> 14:13.102
‎Militech and Arasaka
‎will catch on any time now.

14:13.185 --> 14:14.603
‎Then we've no choice.

14:16.981 --> 14:18.232
‎Kyoko? What is it?

14:19.108 --> 14:22.361
‎The missiles have been launched.
‎Impact in 3 minutes.

14:24.905 --> 14:27.783
‎Shit. They actually did it.

14:27.867 --> 14:29.285
‎The bombs are on their way.

14:30.119 --> 14:32.872
‎Listen closely.
‎Hit the brakes when I give the signal.

14:32.955 --> 14:35.749
‎I'll activate this
‎at the last possible second!

14:35.833 --> 14:36.917
‎But...

14:37.001 --> 14:39.211
‎D is somewhere in that thing!

14:39.295 --> 14:42.965
‎Soon as it collapses,
‎come back and kick his ass awake!

14:43.048 --> 14:44.383
‎That's insane!

14:44.466 --> 14:46.969
‎It's the only option we've got!
‎Now, brake!

14:47.052 --> 14:49.179
‎What're you gonna do, Kyoko?!

14:54.810 --> 14:56.270
‎Shit.

14:56.353 --> 14:58.731
‎It's all or nothing now.

14:58.814 --> 15:01.442
‎This is definitely ‎not
‎how I saw this going.

16:26.402 --> 16:28.529
‎D. Wake up.

16:33.242 --> 16:34.910
‎Wake up!

16:36.036 --> 16:37.037
‎Roman?

16:42.126 --> 16:45.671
‎Look, Talia, you're standing.
‎That's my girl.

16:45.754 --> 16:47.089
‎I'm proud of you.

16:47.172 --> 16:50.676
‎Here. Let's try this one.
‎It's our company's product.

16:51.885 --> 16:54.763
‎I hope you know
‎I'm doing this for you.

16:55.681 --> 16:56.765
‎It's all for you.

16:59.560 --> 17:01.895
‎This isn't like you, Capri.

17:03.897 --> 17:05.149
‎You're acting like me.

17:06.817 --> 17:08.444
‎Who the hell are you?

17:09.653 --> 17:10.946
‎I'm not here for you.

17:11.030 --> 17:14.575
‎Answer the damn question!

17:16.493 --> 17:18.412
‎Fair enough!

17:26.962 --> 17:28.839
‎Well, that ain't fair.

17:33.886 --> 17:35.095
‎Hey, take it easy.

17:44.897 --> 17:45.898
‎You know...

17:46.523 --> 17:49.151
‎I came all the way to get you, Capri.

17:57.493 --> 17:58.577
‎D!

17:59.953 --> 18:02.331
‎Hey. Hey. Capri.

18:03.665 --> 18:05.084
‎Come on, Capri!

18:05.584 --> 18:06.585
‎Whoa!

18:10.839 --> 18:12.591
‎Get a grip.

18:13.300 --> 18:15.302
‎Got swallowed up by all her feelings.

18:17.387 --> 18:19.431
‎Oh, it's you.

18:19.515 --> 18:21.850
‎-Been a minute.
‎-Been a while.

18:27.231 --> 18:30.275
‎What's up? Oh. Is it your turn again?

18:30.359 --> 18:31.360
‎This time...

18:32.027 --> 18:33.612
‎This time's gonna be different.

18:34.780 --> 18:36.824
‎Let's have some fun. Just you and me.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.493
‎Capri.

18:46.333 --> 18:47.334
‎D!

18:48.335 --> 18:49.753
‎Hey, Roman.

18:51.004 --> 18:52.005
‎Here. Take her.

18:52.089 --> 18:53.173
‎Talia!

18:54.758 --> 18:56.593
‎You good, choom?

18:56.677 --> 18:58.095
‎Yeah, I got her...

19:00.597 --> 19:01.890
‎Oof...

19:05.602 --> 19:07.521
‎Ow! Wha--

19:07.604 --> 19:09.022
‎The hell is this?

19:09.106 --> 19:11.692
‎You were falling apart,
‎so I patched you back up!

19:11.775 --> 19:13.277
‎A little reinforcement.

19:13.944 --> 19:16.280
‎-Looks stupid.
‎-Didn't have much to work with.

19:16.363 --> 19:18.782
‎Feel like you didn't try very hard.

19:18.866 --> 19:20.993
‎This her arm? Can I use it?

19:39.761 --> 19:41.889
‎You need to keep moving.

19:42.639 --> 19:45.601
‎The corpos'll be back again.

19:47.769 --> 19:49.271
‎You're still hanging on?

19:50.022 --> 19:52.733
‎The next wave won't
‎be bargain-bin security.

19:53.567 --> 19:57.654
‎Arasaka and Militech will be
‎joining the scramble for you...

19:58.780 --> 19:59.990
‎Cool.

20:01.074 --> 20:02.075
‎Wanna watch?

20:08.707 --> 20:09.958
‎She dead?

20:11.084 --> 20:12.085
‎Can't tell.

20:18.383 --> 20:21.136
‎Hey, D! Did you find Capri?

20:22.179 --> 20:23.222
‎Yeah.

20:25.474 --> 20:28.477
‎So this is it... the climax of your story.

20:29.144 --> 20:30.229
‎Isn't it?

20:32.064 --> 20:33.232
‎I'm comin' with you.

20:34.191 --> 20:36.443
‎Can't miss this! It's your--

20:36.526 --> 20:38.028
‎Forget it, Roman.

20:38.111 --> 20:40.113
‎If I don't film it, who will?

20:40.906 --> 20:44.201
‎I'll scroll it for you. Watched
‎you enough times. I know the drill.

20:45.369 --> 20:47.246
‎Like this, right?

20:52.834 --> 20:53.877
‎You can't.

21:05.681 --> 21:08.642
‎You're planning to die, aren't you?
‎That's it, isn't it?!

21:09.643 --> 21:12.354
‎Roman. You and that camera
‎are gonna get other chances.

21:13.188 --> 21:14.523
‎That's not fair.

21:15.315 --> 21:18.193
‎This is the high point
‎of my story. Not yours.

21:18.902 --> 21:20.070
‎That's not fair!

21:21.029 --> 21:22.990
‎You still have a lot ahead of you.

21:25.492 --> 21:27.494
‎That's not fair! I...

21:27.577 --> 21:28.620
‎Roman.

21:33.750 --> 21:35.127
‎I'm sorry.

21:45.762 --> 21:48.265
‎Take care of Roman. And her, too.

21:50.892 --> 21:51.893
‎You headin' out?

21:52.728 --> 21:53.729
‎Yeah.

21:55.272 --> 21:56.273
‎David.

21:57.482 --> 21:58.525
‎Know what?

21:59.234 --> 22:00.861
‎You're an idiot.

22:09.161 --> 22:10.162
‎Hey, Capri?

22:12.247 --> 22:15.500
‎A while back, there was this guy
‎with the same name as me.

22:16.168 --> 22:17.252
‎Huh.

22:17.336 --> 22:18.754
‎Had his own people.

22:19.671 --> 22:22.632
‎Chose to die for them in the end.

22:23.800 --> 22:25.594
‎Least... that's what it looked like to me.

22:27.179 --> 22:28.805
‎Not sure I could do that.

22:30.015 --> 22:33.143
‎What do you think was
‎goin' through his mind?

22:34.311 --> 22:35.353
‎Beats me.

22:35.979 --> 22:36.980
‎Why?

22:37.939 --> 22:40.150
‎Any reason you bring that up now?

22:41.193 --> 22:44.571
‎Dunno. Talking with Omi
‎made me think of him.

22:45.322 --> 22:46.615
‎Here they come.

22:57.584 --> 23:00.504
‎Alright, Capri. Let's have some fun.

23:13.600 --> 23:14.976
‎That it?

23:15.936 --> 23:18.355
‎Over already?

23:29.241 --> 23:31.535
‎Look up there! Think we can make it?

23:35.622 --> 23:36.623
‎Sure we can.

23:38.792 --> 23:40.627
‎Take care, Roman!

23:42.045 --> 23:44.131
‎That's where the reel ends.

23:47.008 --> 23:48.343
‎D was an idiot.

23:50.846 --> 23:54.766
‎The cause of the widespread
‎blackout remains unknown.

23:54.850 --> 23:57.561
‎Eyewitness accounts describe seeing

23:57.644 --> 24:00.522
‎a strange mass of machinery
‎moments prior to the explosion,

24:00.605 --> 24:03.275
‎but all the footage of the incident
‎has seemingly been corrupted.

24:04.151 --> 24:05.986
‎What do you think happened to D?

24:06.069 --> 24:07.654
‎There's no way he survived.

24:08.780 --> 24:11.533
‎That's just the kinda guy he was.

24:12.159 --> 24:13.910
‎What? You're filming?

24:13.994 --> 24:18.456
‎Yeah. The fact that we got Talia
‎outta there... it was a miracle.

24:19.666 --> 24:21.418
‎Avida was watchin' over us.

24:22.002 --> 24:23.003
‎I'm sure of it.

24:23.503 --> 24:26.131
‎Oh, shit. Oh, shit!

24:26.214 --> 24:27.382
‎Miguel!

24:27.465 --> 24:28.466
‎You know him?

24:30.677 --> 24:33.263
‎Just an old choom.

24:33.346 --> 24:36.308
‎I'm afraid it seems
‎her recovery was only temporary.

24:36.391 --> 24:37.726
‎There's nothin' you can do?

24:37.809 --> 24:39.811
‎First, we need to remove her implants...

24:40.437 --> 24:41.646
‎It's a nice place, right?

24:42.480 --> 24:44.941
‎That's what Weak says.

24:45.025 --> 24:46.526
‎But I've never been.

24:48.236 --> 24:49.237
‎What?

24:51.865 --> 24:54.576
‎Why the long face? Gonna miss me?

24:55.243 --> 24:57.454
‎-Need a hand?
‎-I'm fine.

24:58.413 --> 25:00.332
‎Take care, Roman.

25:00.415 --> 25:01.958
‎You too, Talia.

25:04.336 --> 25:05.962
‎Ping me when you get there!

25:06.046 --> 25:08.423
‎I'll come visit! And scroll you again.

25:09.090 --> 25:11.718
‎Yeah... Looking forward to it.

25:18.892 --> 25:20.977
‎I'm off, then.

25:21.061 --> 25:22.771
‎You sure?

25:24.272 --> 25:26.233
‎I'll see him again.

25:27.984 --> 25:30.195
‎Wait! Talia.

25:30.820 --> 25:35.033
‎I don't want you to go!
‎You can't leave! Just--

25:36.117 --> 25:37.160
‎Please don't go!

25:38.245 --> 25:41.164
‎I want you to stay! Please!

25:41.248 --> 25:42.540
‎Talia!

25:45.460 --> 25:46.461
‎Roman.

25:47.087 --> 25:49.422
‎We'll see each other again.

25:50.966 --> 25:52.050
‎Okay.

25:52.133 --> 25:56.054
‎Until then, you just keep
‎that camera rollin', huh?

25:57.055 --> 25:58.056
‎Okay.

25:58.139 --> 26:00.809
‎Then you can come show me what you made.

26:01.643 --> 26:06.064
‎Scroll somethin' so great
‎it'll make all this crap feel small.

26:06.147 --> 26:09.025
‎-D'you think I can?
‎-I know you can.

26:09.818 --> 26:12.404
‎You scrolled me lookin'
‎perfect back then, didn't you?

26:13.238 --> 26:14.489
‎It'll be a piece of cake.

26:17.534 --> 26:20.245
‎You were perfect, Talia.

26:20.829 --> 26:21.997
‎You always have been.

